# Blocksmith bug notes

Spoken while playing (Options > Interface > Bug Notes). Newest at the bottom.
Each entry: transcript, game state, screenshot and audio. Set Status to fixed (with the commit) once handled;
see BUGNOTES.md in the repo.

## 2026-10-05 00:41:31 - the zombie walked through the fence (33 buffers)

